					<![CDATA[
						 <div class="image-container aligncenter"><a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/191621170@N04/50788457467/"><img src="https://farm66.static.flickr.com/65535/50788457467_e5cf3f4e52.jpg" alt="flickr:50788457467" class="image" /></a></div> <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <p><strong>Item #:</strong> SCP-5951</p> <p><strong>Object Class:</strong> Safe</p> <p><strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong><br /> SCP-5951 is to be kept in a standard secure locker in Site-77.</p> <p>Personnel with Level 2 or higher security clearance are authorized to use SCP-5951 for recreational purposes after filling out the appropriate paperwork.</p> <p><strong>Description:</strong><br /> SCP-5951 is a packet of Carnation Breakfast Essential Breakfast Mix with a seemingly infinite amount of powder inside it. In all prior testing, SCP-5951 has shown no difference from Non-Anomalous Carnation Breakfast Essential Powder. Hence, SCP-5951 has since been deemed as safe to be used for recreational purposes.</p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jssrocket" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6420318&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609536248" alt="JSSRocket" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6420318)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jssrocket" >JSSRocket</a></span></p> 
