&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mr-intertab&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6628226&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609536248&quot; alt=&quot;mr intertab&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6628226)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mr-intertab&quot;  &gt;mr intertab&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 31 Dec 2020 20:33:19 +0000</pubDate>
												<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <div class="info-container"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&nbsp;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&nbsp;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div> <p>This is the official documentation of SCP-5217</p> <p><strong>Image sources:</strong></p> <p>[[&gt;</p> </div> <hr /> <div id="u-author_block"> <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/ralliston-s-authorpage">▸ More by this Author ◂</a></p> <hr /></div> <div class="translation_block"> <h1><span>Translations:</span></h1> </div> <div class="u-faq"> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/component:info-ayers">F.A.Q.</a></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong>SCP 5217</strong></p> <p><strong>Item #:</strong> SCP-5217</p> <strong>Object Class:</strong> Euclid<br /> <img src="https://u5j4h3u7.stackpathcdn.com/pub/media/catalog/product/cache/172d96e30d7cd3d4380b53391edef300/J/B/JBFST.jpg" alt="JBFST.jpg" class="image" /><br /> <strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong> SCP-5217 Needs to be kept away from any person unless said person is wearing correct Hazardous-Materials suit and follows the correct cleaning procedures after encounter with item SCP-5217 <p><strong>Description:</strong> SCP-5217 Was found back in 2003 after a civilian came into contact with a seemingly normal gelatine product, or jelly bean, and fell into a deep coma dying only hours later police officers were called to analyse the product and found a elemental composition that is unfound in normal versions of this product. Later analysis shows that this product has a living biological composition and naturally releases a toxic gas into the air nearby and is coated in a poison similar to that of a poison dart frog</p> <p>Images product of Hancocks.co.uk</p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mr-intertab" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6628226&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609536248" alt="mr intertab" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6628226)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mr-intertab" >mr intertab</a></span></p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5368</guid>
				<title>SCP-5368</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5368</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt;SCP-5368&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Safe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5368 must be contained in a 12x6 room with a large glass window for distant inspections. When inspecting SCP-5368 from inside the chamber, please wear gloves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5368, otherwise known as The Gun, The gun is a Mauser M1887 the gun was made for ww1, country of origin Germany we believe it was made by Königliche Waffen Schmieden in 1918 but we have no proof of this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5368 was found in a Trench November 11, 1918 By Major Paul Muller When the gun was found it was displaying anomalous properties Such as levitation but no other signs, and the gun was taken for further study, When it was taken a ceasefire was broken immediately, now its held in a 12x6 room on a pedestal When there&#039;s a Fight at site 19 the gun will start to float and the fighting will stop and continue after a random amount of time or if it is disturbed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;image-container alignright&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://www.militaryrifles.com/Turkey/TurkMaus01.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;TurkMaus01.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-blau&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7166385&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609536248&quot; alt=&quot;Dr Blau&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7166385)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-blau&quot;  &gt;Dr Blau&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 31 Dec 2020 19:59:14 +0000</pubDate>
												<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <hr /> <p><strong>Item #:</strong>SCP-5368</p> <p><strong>Object Class:</strong> Safe</p> <p><strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong></p> <p>SCP-5368 must be contained in a 12x6 room with a large glass window for distant inspections. When inspecting SCP-5368 from inside the chamber, please wear gloves.</p> <p><strong>Description:</strong></p> <p>SCP-5368, otherwise known as The Gun, The gun is a Mauser M1887 the gun was made for ww1, country of origin Germany we believe it was made by Königliche Waffen Schmieden in 1918 but we have no proof of this.</p> <p><strong>Addendum:</strong></p> <p>SCP-5368 was found in a Trench November 11, 1918 By Major Paul Muller When the gun was found it was displaying anomalous properties Such as levitation but no other signs, and the gun was taken for further study, When it was taken a ceasefire was broken immediately, now its held in a 12x6 room on a pedestal When there's a Fight at site 19 the gun will start to float and the fighting will stop and continue after a random amount of time or if it is disturbed.</p> <div class="image-container alignright"><img src="http://www.militaryrifles.com/Turkey/TurkMaus01.jpg" alt="TurkMaus01.jpg" class="image" /></div> <hr /> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-blau" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7166385&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609536248" alt="Dr Blau" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7166385)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-blau" >Dr Blau</a></span></p> 
				 	]]>
